<title>SWEDEN: Ave yld 6.92 pct in Swedish nine-yr bond auction.</title>
<headline>Ave yld 6.92 pct in Swedish nine-yr bond auction.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average accepted yield on an auction of two billion crowns of nine-year bonds was 6.92 percent, the National Debt Office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>						Loan 1038</p>
<p>Volume issued (billions)		1.99</p>
<p>Total bids    (billions)		5.22</p>
<p>Number of accepted bids		 8</p>
<p>Number of bids			    47</p>
<p>Lowest yields			     6.915</p>
<p>Highest yields			    6.920</p>
<p>Weighted average yield		  6.919</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
</text>
